      "widgets_values": [
        "Load the TARGET PHOTO and edit SELECT ONE PERSON. Run. White must select ONLY the person to replace; all other people must be black. Use a short clothing/position description, not a comma-separated list. Start with mask margin 0. This test loads only SAM3, not H3. After verifying, use the same photo, description and SAM settings in H3_Replace_One_Person_SAM3.json. If the target is wrong or missing, do not render H3 yet. Refine the description and inspect again. Install the single SAM checkpoint using setup_h3_sam3.py. No custom-node package is needed."
      ],
      "widgets_values_named": {
        "text": "Load the TARGET PHOTO and edit SELECT ONE PERSON. Run. White must select ONLY the person to replace; all other people must be black. Use a short clothing/position description, not a comma-separated list. Start with mask margin 0. This test loads only SAM3, not H3. After verifying, use the same photo, description and SAM settings in H3_Replace_One_Person_SAM3.json. If the target is wrong or missing, do not render H3 yet. Refine the description and inspect again. Install the single SAM checkpoint using setup_h3_sam3.py. No custom-node package is needed."
